# 中屏 (an opened fold upright), a finger: a chat chosen from the sidebar, then every frame for 3.75 s built whole,
# keeping nothing (scripts/appbench.sh runs it MBUI_BENCH_WHOLE=1): what building the whole window anew costs, whatever
# it is built for. Some 450 frames, some 300 ms of work in all: a bench sized so.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 500
tap 夜里的构建又失败了
wait 1000
log measure
wait 3750
exit
